  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7221301",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722130101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722130101": {
            "id": "722130101",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "\"Celery\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130102"
            ]
          },
          "722130102": {
            "id": "722130102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How's the statue?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130103"
            ]
          },
          "722130103": {
            "id": "722130103",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "That stone human is most skilled, meow meow meow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130104"
            ]
          },
          "722130104": {
            "id": "722130104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is it done?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130105"
            ]
          },
          "722130105": {
            "id": "722130105",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "No, but before I knew it, he had brought a big, big stone over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130106"
            ]
          },
          "722130106": {
            "id": "722130106",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "He then started to knock on it, donk-donk-donk, all while muttering things about \"employer\" and \"salary.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130107"
            ]
          },
          "722130107": {
            "id": "722130107",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Speaking of which, I would like to ask: what is an \"envoyer,\" and what is \"celery\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130108"
            ]
          },
          "722130108": {
            "id": "722130108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think you mean \"employer\" and \"salary.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130109"
            ]
          },
          "722130109": {
            "id": "722130109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Basically, since you asked him to do something, he should be given something in return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130110"
            ]
          },
          "722130110": {
            "id": "722130110",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Ah, is that the case? So humans are particular about such things... Alright. I shall permit him to scratch my ears.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130111"
            ]
          },
          "722130111": {
            "id": "722130111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, Paimon doesn't think that's enough...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130112"
            ]
          },
          "722130112": {
            "id": "722130112",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Is it not? Hmm, then perhaps I should give him something to eat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130113"
            ]
          },
          "722130113": {
            "id": "722130113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think what he wants is Mora...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130114"
            ]
          },
          "722130114": {
            "id": "722130114",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Mora? Are these things not for shoving inside the Offering Box? How strange. To think that humans were concerned about such things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130115"
            ]
          },
          "722130115": {
            "id": "722130115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, a salary is very important, actually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130116"
            ]
          },
          "722130116": {
            "id": "722130116",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Mmph. I will trust your words on account of the aid you've provided so far. I will speak to the stone human when we return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130117"
            ]
          },
          "722130117": {
            "id": "722130117",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "However, the stone human is no longer going donk-donk-donk. He seems to be carrying a short wooden pole, who knows what for...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130118"
            ]
          },
          "722130118": {
            "id": "722130118",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A wooden pole? Isn't statue-carving done with a hammer, a chisel, and stuff like that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130119"
            ]
          },
          "722130119": {
            "id": "722130119",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Did his tools break or something...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130120"
            ]
          },
          "722130120": {
            "id": "722130120",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Oh brother. Come on then, {NICKNAME}, let's go find Mr. Ooshima. Sounds like he needs some help!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7221302",
      "subQuestName": "Ask Ooshima Junpei some questions",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722130301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722130301": {
            "id": "722130301",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "*sigh* How am I supposed to work without a hammer or chisel...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130302"
            ]
          },
          "722130302": {
            "id": "722130302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Encountering some trouble?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130303"
            ]
          },
          "722130303": {
            "id": "722130303",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "Oh, it's you. Well... I was careless. I didn't check my tools properly when we came here, so just as I was getting engrossed in my work, I broke my hammer and chisel by mistake...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130304"
            ]
          },
          "722130304": {
            "id": "722130304",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "I'd like to return to Narukami Island to buy some more, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130305"
            ]
          },
          "722130305": {
            "id": "722130305",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "How do I put this... I guess I'm just more used to finishing work like this in one go, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130306"
            ]
          },
          "722130306": {
            "id": "722130306",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "My tools might be broken, but I can still do some measurements and figure out how I want to continue carving.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130307"
            ]
          },
          "722130307": {
            "id": "722130307",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "If I left now and went to Narukami Island to get some tools, I'd probably have to re-acquaint myself with the \"feel\" of this carving...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130308"
            ]
          },
          "722130308": {
            "id": "722130308",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "Also, this stone's composition is very hard. If we were to use ordinary tools, they would break pretty quickly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130309"
            ]
          },
          "722130309": {
            "id": "722130309",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "Hmm, you know what...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130310"
            ]
          },
          "722130310": {
            "id": "722130310",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "Traveler, could you help me find 3 Iron Chunks?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130311"
            ]
          },
          "722130311": {
            "id": "722130311",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "I plan on making some tools personally, ones suited to the task.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130313",
              "722130315"
            ]
          },
          "722130313": {
            "id": "722130313",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "Great! It's up to you, then."
          },
          "722130315": {
            "id": "722130315",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "Come on, I'm someone who worked at Tatarasuna. Of course I know a thing or three about forging.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130316"
            ]
          },
          "722130316": {
            "id": "722130316",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "However, I probably shouldn't start any sort of furnace at the shrine. I imagine that the Lady Priestess would be displeased. It is a cat, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722130317"
            ]
          },
          "722130317": {
            "id": "722130317",
            "speakerId": 3182,
            "speakerName": "Ooshima Junpei",
            "text": "Either way, please help me find 3 Iron Chunks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7221303",
